{
  "id": 8833357742279,
  "title": "Custom Tree of Life Quilt Set Celtic Yggdrasil Bedding for Bedroom Decor",
  "handle": "custom-tree-of-life-quilt-set-yggdrasil-bedding-0038a4731b-0038a4731b",
  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the symbolic beauty and serene energy of the sacred tree with the Tree of Life Quilt Set by Jeminise. This beautifully designed bedding set showcases the intricate Yggdrasil and Celtic Tree of Life patterns, blending natural elegance with cozy comfort. Crafted for nature lovers, it serves as a stunning focal point for any bedroom decor while offering the versatile warmth you need for peaceful, year-round rest.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Fully customizable options allow you to personalize the background, framing colors, and text saying squares to create a truly unique keepsake or dedicated gift.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>High-Quality Material:</strong> Made from 100% soft polyester with a breathable outer fabric layer and a premium silk floss filling for lightweight warmth and long-lasting durability.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Exceptionally functional as a cozy bed quilt, a comfortable throw blanket, an outdoor picnic mat, or a warm companion for camping trips.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in a versatile range of sizes including Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (91x102 inches).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Optional Components:</strong> Complete your custom bedding set by selecting your preferred quilt size and optionally adding matching pillowcases (available in sets of 2 or 4).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable fabric engineered to resist pilling, fading, and wrinkling, making it low-maintenance and quick to dry.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Farmhouse</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Tree of life, flowers</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Tree of life, Yggdrasil</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Tree-ds05</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + Pillowcases (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
